{
	title: "Asbestos and Mesothelioma",
	x: 3.5d,
	y: 2.0d,
	text: [
		"Mesothelioma is a disease caused by prolonged inhalation of asbestos particles. Technically, it's a counter, adding 1 per asbestos sheet and 3 per asbestos powder in inventory a tick, up to 60*60*20 (72000). Once that limit is reached, the player will die with a unique death message: \"Player was entitled to a financial compensation\".",
		"",
		"Mesothelioma can be prevented by wearing a gas mask with a filter having the Particulates trait (Gas Mask filter and Gas Mask Combo filter) and can be reset using SiOX Cancer Medication or Herbal Paste."
	],
